# BEN Engine edge computer — Mosquitto ACL (generated by install.sh from UNIT id and Pod count)
# A Pod authenticates with its X.509 device certificate; the username IS the certificate CN
# (pod-__UNIT__-podN). It may publish only on its own telemetry/status/ack topics and read only its own
# cmd topic. The API service (user "benapi", certificate CN on the controls listeners, password on the
# management listener) reads everything and writes cmd/equip/plc/alarm/twin topics.
# __UNIT__ is replaced at install time.

user benapi
topic readwrite ben/__UNIT__/#

user dashboard
topic read ben/__UNIT__/#

# --- one block per Pod (appended by ben-add-pod.sh) ---
# user pod-__UNIT__-podN
# topic write ben/__UNIT__/node/podN/telemetry
# topic write ben/__UNIT__/node/podN/status
# topic write ben/__UNIT__/node/podN/ack
# topic read  ben/__UNIT__/node/podN/cmd
